  "The connection is locked by the platform. Workspace preferences cannot override this lock; contact a platform administrator.": {"tr":"Bağlantı platform tarafından kilitlendi. Çalışma alanı tercihi bu kilidi kaldıramaz; platform yöneticisine başvurun.","en":"The connection is locked by the platform. Workspace preferences cannot override this lock; contact a platform administrator."},
